  "prefLabel": "Ed 402.01 Annual Reports",
  "priorExpiration": "2004-10-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 402.01 Annual Reports.\n\n(a) Each nonpublic school shall report enrollment by grade as of October 1 of the reporting year on a deadline established by the department.\n\n(b) Each nonpublic school shall complete and submit “Nonpublic Restraint and Seclusion Data Collection,” revised November 2023. The form shall be completed online at https://my.doe.nh.gov/myNHDOE/Login/Login.aspx by June 30 of each year.\n\nSource. #2055, eff 6-16-82; ss by #2714, eff 5-16-84; ss by #4372, eff 2-24-88; ss by #4961, eff 10-26-90; EXPIRED: 10-26-96\n\nNew. #6366, eff 10-30-96, EXPIRED: 10-30-04\n\nNew. #8263, eff 1-22-05; ss by #10360, eff 6-15-13; ss by #13853, eff 1-11-24 (formerly Ed 403.03)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed400.html"
